#!/bin/sh
# Prints the session-start mandate. hooks.json passes Droid's plugin root as $1 only on Droid,
# whose skills have no `postman:` prefix. session-start.cmd is this script for cmd.exe.
if [ -n "$1" ]; then
    sed 's/`postman:\([a-z0-9-]*\)`/`\1`/g' "${0%/*}/session-start-context.md"
else
    cat "${0%/*}/session-start-context.md"
fi
